---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"GaN Device Testing | Gallium Nitride Characterization with Cassini ATE"}
  description={"Characterize and validate Gallium Nitride (GaN) power semiconductors with Cassini ATE. Perform double pulse testing, Eon/Eoff measurements, dynamic RDS(on) analysis, reliability testing, and precision parametric characterization."}
  active={["nav-support"]}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <meta name="theme-color" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" content="#f0f0f0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/css/cookieconsent.min.css" />
    <script is:inline src="/js/cookieconsent.min.js"></script>
    <script is:inline>
        window.addEventListener("load", function () {
            window.cookieconsent.initialise({
                "palette": {
                    "popup": {
                        "background": "#252e39"
                    },
                    "button": {
                        "background": "#4676B8"
                    }
                },
                "position": "bottom-left",
                "type": "opt-in",
                "content": {
                    "message": "This website uses cookies when logged in and when searching to ensure you get the best experience.",
                    "dismiss": "Dismiss",
                    "allow": "Allow cookies",
                    "link": "Learn more",
                    "href": "https://roos.com/privacy.html"
                }
            })
        });
    </script>
  </Fragment>
        <!-- ==========================
        	BREADCRUMB - START
        =========================== -->
        <section class="breadcrumb-wrapper">
            <div class="container">
                <h2>Testing Gallium Nitride (GaN) Devices</h2>                <ol class="breadcrumb">
                    <li><a href="/index.html">Home</a></li>
                    <li><a href="/products.html">Products Overview</a></li>
                    <li class="active">Testing GaN Devices</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </section>
        <!-- ==========================
        	BREADCRUMB - END
        =========================== -->

        <div id="content" class="roosC container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h1>Test Gallium Nitride (GaN) Devices with Confidence</h1>
                    <p class="main">
                        Modern Gallium Nitride (GaN) power devices are enabling higher efficiency, faster switching speeds,
                        and greater power density than traditional silicon technologies. As device performance advances,
                        characterization and production testing become increasingly demanding.
                    </p>
                    <p class="main">
                        Cassini ATE provides the instrumentation, software, and data analysis tools required to
                        characterize, validate, and optimize GaN devices throughout development, qualification, and
                        manufacturing.
                    </p>
                    <div class="btn-group">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact.html">Request a Demo</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-default" href="/contact.html">Talk to an Applications Engineer</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Why GaN Technology Matters</h2>
                    <p class="main">
                        GaN power semiconductors are accelerating innovation across power conversion applications by
                        enabling higher switching frequencies, improved power density, lower switching losses, increased
                        system efficiency, and smaller and lighter power electronics systems.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Higher Switching Frequencies</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">Reduce passive component size and increase system performance.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Improved Power Density</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">Deliver more power in smaller and lighter systems.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Lower Switching Losses</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">Enhance efficiency across power conversion applications.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Increased Efficiency</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">Support demanding thermal and energy requirements.</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h3>Common GaN Applications</h3>
                    <ul class="main">
                        <li>Power Supplies</li>
                        <li>Motor Control Systems</li>
                        <li>Electric and Hybrid Vehicles</li>
                        <li>Telecommunications Infrastructure</li>
                        <li>AI and Data Center Servers</li>
                        <li>Robotics and Industrial Automation</li>
                        <li>Drones and Aerospace Systems</li>
                        <li>Consumer and Industrial Appliances</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Challenges of Testing GaN Devices</h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">High Voltage and High Current Characterization</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Power GaN devices frequently operate at elevated voltages and high peak currents. Test systems
                            must safely source and measure these conditions while maintaining measurement accuracy and
                            repeatability.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Fast Switching Dynamics</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            GaN devices switch significantly faster than conventional silicon technologies, requiring precise
                            measurement of switching events, transient behavior, dv/dt, and di/dt characteristics.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Low Current and Leakage Measurements</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            The wide-bandgap properties of GaN can enable extremely low off-state currents, creating a need
                            for sensitive measurement instrumentation capable of resolving very small leakage currents while
                            also supporting high-voltage test conditions.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Dynamic Device Behavior</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Accurate characterization increasingly requires evaluation of dynamic RDS(on), switching energy
                            losses, thermal effects, parasitic interactions, and transient operating conditions.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Manufacturing and Reliability Challenges</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Maintaining high-quality epitaxial GaN layers on silicon substrates remains an important
                            manufacturing challenge. Material and thermal expansion mismatches can introduce defects that
                            impact performance, yield, and reliability.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Cassini ATE Solutions for GaN Device Testing</h2>
                    <p class="main">
                        Cassini ATE delivers a scalable platform for development, characterization, reliability, and
                        production test of GaN devices.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Double Pulse Switching Testing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Characterize hard-switching turn-on and turn-off behavior using industry-standard Double Pulse
                            Test methodologies.
                            <ul>
                                <li>Turn-on energy (Eon)</li>
                                <li>Turn-off energy (Eoff)</li>
                                <li>Switching loss analysis</li>
                                <li>Voltage overshoot</li>
                                <li>Current overshoot</li>
                                <li>Dynamic switching behavior</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Precision Parametric Characterization</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Accurately source and measure high voltages, high peak currents, ultra-low leakage currents,
                            and static and dynamic device parameters.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Dynamic Performance Analysis</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Gain insight into device operation through advanced characterization of dynamic RDS(on), dv/dt,
                            di/dt, switching efficiencies, and thermal behavior.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Structural and Electrical Characterization</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Evaluate device integrity using electrical characterization techniques that complement
                            traditional physical inspection methods and help identify defect-related behavior earlier in the
                            development cycle.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Reliability and Stress Testing</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Characterize long-term device performance through intrinsic reliability testing, electrical stress
                            testing, aging analysis, and failure characterization.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Data Analytics and Reporting</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Integrated software tools enable custom test development, automated measurements, statistical
                            analysis, device comparison studies, and production data management.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Applications Supported by Cassini ATE</h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Automotive Electronics</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Validate GaN devices used in onboard chargers, DC/DC converters, traction systems, and advanced
                            vehicle electronics.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Telecommunications Infrastructure</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Characterize devices supporting high-efficiency power conversion for next-generation communication
                            systems.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">AI and Data Centers</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Optimize power semiconductor performance for servers and high-density computing platforms.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Industrial Power Systems</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Test devices for motor drives, automation equipment, and industrial power conversion systems.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Robotics and Autonomous Systems</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Evaluate high-efficiency power components used in robotics and intelligent automation.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-4">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Aerospace and Drone Applications</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Characterize devices operating in demanding power and environmental conditions.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Why Choose Cassini ATE</h2>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Comprehensive Test Hardware</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Cassini ATE combines fast RF sources, accurate RF power amplifiers, high-current resources,
                            pulsed DC capability, and precision measurement instrumentation.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Flexible Development Environment</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Create custom test programs tailored to your device architecture, performance goals, and
                            qualification requirements.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Accelerated Characterization</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Generate detailed electrical characterization data that helps engineers understand performance
                            limits, optimize designs, and reduce time to market.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="col-sm-3">
                    <div class="panel panel-default">
                        <div class="panel-heading">
                            <h3 class="panel-title">Scalable Test Architecture</h3>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-body">
                            Support device research, engineering validation, reliability studies, and production deployment
                            using a common platform.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12">
                    <h2>Configuring a Cassini ATE Solution for GaN Devices</h2>
                    <p class="main">
                        Every GaN application has unique requirements. A successful test strategy begins with understanding:
                    </p>
                    <ul class="main">
                        <li>Operating voltage requirements</li>
                        <li>Peak current conditions</li>
                        <li>Switching frequencies</li>
                        <li>Power handling requirements</li>
                        <li>Reliability objectives</li>
                        <li>Characterization goals</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p class="main">
                        Cassini ATE can be configured to support functional testing, parametric testing, structural
                        testing, reliability evaluation, switching characterization, and production screening.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <hr class="space">

            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-sm-12 text-center">
                    <h2>Ready to Advance Your GaN Test Strategy?</h2>
                    <p class="main">
                        From device characterization and switching analysis to reliability qualification and production test,
                        Cassini ATE provides the tools needed to evaluate modern GaN power semiconductors with confidence.
                    </p>
                    <div class="btn-group">
                        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact.html">Request a Demo</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-default" href="/contact.html">Speak with an Applications Engineer</a>
                        <a class="btn btn-default" href="/tims.html">Configure a Cassini Test Solution</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
</Base>
